  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Collaboration Against Trafficking and Smuggling between Nigeria and the Niger (CATS-NN)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to enhance border management information system (BMIS) used in Niger and Nigeria. Border authorities will have increased means and capacities and data management frameworks in place to enhance capacities to counter trafficking and avert increased risk and insecurity within the sub-region.</narrative>
  </description>
